{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-news-detail-template-js","path":"/blog/provident-estate-top-performing-partner-black-onyx-awards-2024/","result":{"data":{"strapiBlog":{"createdAt":"2024-10-02T06:01:31.954Z","updatedAt":"2024-10-02T12:27:58.894Z","video_url":null,"title":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate Shines at Black Onyx Awards 2024","short_description":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate continues to lead Dubai’s real estate market, earning a distinguished accolade at the Black Onyx Awards 2024, organized by Meraas x Nakheel.","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.jpg"},"team_contact":null,"strapi_id":221,"slug":"provident-estate-top-performing-partner-black-onyx-awards-2024","publish":true,"id":"e211c3bf-a42c-523d-8653-7821373a622f","rank":null,"date":"October 02, 2024","category":{"strapi_json_value":["Dubai Market Trends & News"],"id":"d504e2bf-6843-5f5c-8bd3-5e8eeb461c42"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.jpg"},"author":null,"modules":[{"id":"6bcc92f2-3b2c-552f-a244-38dff10f2996","strapi_component":"components.rich-text-block","strapi_id":468,"text":{"data":{"text":"<p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate continues to lead Dubai’s real estate market, earning a distinguished accolade at the Black Onyx Awards 2024, organized by Meraas x Nakheel. Held on the evening of September 26 at Forum by Banyan Tree on Bluewaters Island, the event celebrated the industry's finest, and Zoya Ventures Real Estate proudly claimed the prestigious <span>Platinum Top Performing Partners</span> award in recognition of its outstanding sales performance throughout the past year.</p><p>This award is a testament to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/\">Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s</a> unwavering dedication to excellence, innovative strategies, and unparalleled commitment to promoting Dubai's iconic master communities and luxury developments. The brokerage has played a pivotal role in connecting clients with properties that define modern elegance, aligning seamlessly with the vision of top-tier developers like <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-meraas/\">Meraas</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-nakheel/\">Nakheel</a>. Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s success lies in its ability to navigate Dubai's real estate market while fostering lasting relationships with developers and clients alike.</p><p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate looks forward to continuing its fruitful collaboration with Meraas and Nakheel, while solidifying its position as a leading real estate brokerage in Dubai. With a focus on maintaining its high performance, Zoya Ventures Real Estate remains dedicated to driving innovation and excellence in one of the world’s most dynamic real estate markets.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" style=\"background:#FFF;border-radius:3px;border:0;box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15);margin:1px;max-width:540px;min-width:326px;padding:0;width:calc(100% - 2px);\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://instagram.com/p/DAipXMLSJ4l/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"align-items:center;display:flex;flex-direction:row;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:50%;flex-grow:0;height:40px;margin-right:14px;width:40px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex-grow:1;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow:0;height:14px;margin-bottom:6px;width:100px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"background-color:#F4F4F4;border-radius:4px;flex-grow