w.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This recognition at the Black Onyx Awards 2024 marks yet another milestone in Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s journey of transforming lives through real estate expertise and exceptional service.</p><h2>Zoya Ventures Real Estate's Strong Ties with Top Developers</h2><p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate has cultivated strong relationships with Dubai’s leading developers, such as Meraas, Nakheel, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar</a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-damac-properties/\">DAMAC</a>, ensuring access to the finest properties in the city’s most sought-after master communities. These partnerships allow Zoya Ventures Real Estate to promote exclusive developments and luxury residences effectively, delivering high-value investment opportunities to its clients.</p><p>Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s promotional strategies are built on innovative marketing techniques, leveraging digital platforms, exclusive events, and targeted campaigns to maximize visibility for premium properties. This approach has not only earned Zoya Ventures Real Estate a stellar reputation but also industry recognition, including the prestigious Top Performing Partners award at the Black Onyx Awards 2024, organized by Meraas x Nakheel. These efforts underscore Zoya Ventures Real Estate’s commitment to aligning with Dubai’s vision of growth and luxury, while continually driving results for both developers and clients.</p><h2>Zoya Ventures Real Estate's Award-Winning Streak in 2024</h2><p>2024 marks yet another milestone for Zoya Ventures Real Estate as our commitment to excellence is recognized with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/about/our-awards/\">prestigious accolades.</a> This year, besides the Black Onyx Award, we proudly secured <strong>10th place at the DAMAC Broker Awards 2024 and 4th place at the Binghatti Broker Awards 2024</strong>, further solidifying our reputation as one of Dubai’s top-performing real estate brokerages.</p>"}}}],"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.webp","transform":"340x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1260x/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.webp","transform":"1260x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1000x/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.webp","transform":"1000x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/696x/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.webp","transform":"696x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/339x/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.webp","transform":"339x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/Provident_Estate_Wins_Big_at_Black_Onyx_Awards_Provident_Estate_d145a3f391.jpg","transform":"340x","format":"jpg"}]}],"seo":{"id":"68fd3e05-b49b-5a4d-9ef2-01e575049942","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate receives Top Performing Partner award at Black Onyx Awards 2024 by Meraas and Nakheel. Discover more about this prestigious accolade.","metaTitle":"Zoya Ventures Real Estate Wins Big at Black Onyx Awards","strapi_id":1031}}},"pageContext":{"id":"e211c3bf-a42c-523d-8653-7821373a622f"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1722115342","1797776728","2073252141","3432741055","3472835299","3592264445","3783427077","411